# Local-only scratch documentation.
#
# This used to be a blanket `*.md` + `!README.md`, which silently excluded
# docs/ and would have swallowed SECURITY.md and CONTRIBUTING.md. Ignore
# specific throwaway files instead of every markdown file in the repo.
DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md

# Local API smoke-test scripts.
#
# Previously `*test*.ts` / `*test*.js` / `test-*`, which would have silently
# excluded any real unit test named *.test.ts from version control.
test-contact-api.js
test-*.local.*

# Development scripts
*.ps1
update_lineage_details.ps1
clean_images.ps1
replace_images.ps1

# Development API server (CommonJS version for local dev only)
dev-api-server.cjs
api/*.cjs

# API testing endpoints
api/test.ts
